# The ruling: "If Raubahn is no longer on the battlefield at that time, use Raubahn's power as it last existed." Bot2 casts
# Lightning Bolt at Raubahn, a 4/2 with the Bloodforged Battle-Axe, and with the first ward trigger still on the stack casts a second Bolt at him. The second
# ward trigger resolves first (Bot2 pays 4), the second Bolt kills him, and the first ward trigger then resolves with him in
# the graveyard: Bot2 is still asked, and pays 4 again, his last known power (20 - 4 - 4 = 12). The first Bolt, with its
# target gone, does nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Raubahn, Bull of Ala Mhigo
Bloodforged Battle-Axe
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
